<title>TURKEY: Turkey sets 2-year bond auction for Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Turkey sets 2-year bond auction for Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish central bank said the Treasury would auction on Tuesday two-year, inflation indexed bonds with three-month coupon payments after it sold 34.60 trillion lira of similar bonds on May 6.</p>
<p>    Maturity    : May 14, 1999</p>
<p>    Amount	: -</p>
<p>    Coupon	: -</p>
<p>Auction date: May 13, 1997</p>
<p>Value date  : May 14, 1997</p>
<p>The central bank has 78.68.1 trillion lira of bond redemption due on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75</p>
</text>
